# Firebase Functions — local tooling / documentation only.
# Production secrets are set with: firebase functions:secrets:set SECRET_NAME
# See LEMON_SQUEEZY_SETUP.md and Firebase console.

# These names match defineSecret() in functions/index.js:
# LEMON_SQUEEZY_API_KEY
# LEMON_SQUEEZY_WEBHOOK_SECRET
# LEMON_SQUEEZY_STORE_ID

# Do not put real keys in a committed file. The receiving team configures secrets in GCP/Firebase.
